    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7667" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνατροπ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>capsizing,</i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ πλοίου</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1013b14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>overthrow, ruin,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνατροπαὶ δωμάτων, οἴκων,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				355
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				325c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. βίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Clearch.
					10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>pouring out,</i> of drink, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Hg.</u>
				2.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>upsetting,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στομάχου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.27
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Asclep.Jun.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.140
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ναυτιώδεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.442f
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>refutation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				2.1.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>6.</b>
			<i>annulment,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Just.
				<u>Nov.</u>
				2.2
			</span></i>
            <u>Intr.</u>; <i>undoing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ -ῇ τῆς νοήσεως τοῦ θεοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>D.</u>
					3.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>7.</b>
			<i>raising</i> of body, <i><span class="en">
				Cass.Fel.
				82
			</span></i>.</div>
